  "subtitle": "Creamy farfalle with pesto, spinach, and savory toppings",
  "description": "Farfalle is tossed with a smooth mascarpone-Parmesan sauce, browned chicken, crisp bacon, spinach, pesto, and sun-dried tomatoes.",
